 	// CEntityPhysics::RemoveSlotGeometry decides what to remove from the statobj's phys geom.
+	// Decision 09. Sampled here, before the physics geometry exists, because the ids are an input to it:
+	// this is where the per face table of step 2 is solved. The rays are terrain only and cost nothing
+	// next to the mesh generation above, and this is the one place that always runs when the plate moves,
